{"4041580": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Scraps Of The Machine", "steam_appid": 4041580, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>FPS Mech Action</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pilot a mass of steel through a single player campaign set in decrepit factories, burning refineries, war torn deserts, and rusted salvage yards.  <br><i>Discover, Destroy, Scavenge.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4041580/extras/fbe60f0bb513eb91fa04084aebfa0b65.poster.avif?t=1780546970\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4041580/extras/fbe60f0bb513eb91fa04084aebfa0b65.webm?t=1780546970\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4041580/extras/fbe60f0bb513eb91fa04084aebfa0b65.mp4?t=1780546970\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Break Them Apart, Piece By Piece</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Target enemy weapons or armor and be rewarded with extra resources. Or crush them quickly with overwhelming firepower.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>But be mindful the enemy can do the same to you...</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4041580/extras/f27fc33e3a42e2b65d38d30d79438a52.poster.avif?t=1780546970\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4041580/extras/f27fc33e3a42e2b65d38d30d79438a52.webm?t=1780546970\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4041580/extras/f27fc33e3a42e2b65d38d30d79438a52.mp4?t=1780546970\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Collect, Resupply, Re-Deploy</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Find upgrades to improve your mech or new weapons through multiple distinct levels. Spend the <i>Scrap</i> on constructing Weapons or upgrades to <i>Hull Integrity</i>, <i>Fuel Capacity</i>, or <i>Weapon Heat Control</i>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4041580/extras/07a01024fe98b05b8693efe712d22a63.poster.avif?t=1780546970\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4041580/extras/07a01024fe98b05b8693efe712d22a63.webm?t=1780546970\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4041580/extras/07a01024fe98b05b8693efe712d22a63.mp4?t=1780546970\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Discover Desolate Territory </strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Constant wars and power struggles have created monumental artificial factories which create endless waves of machines with no purpose and no clear directive. Trapped in a manufactured cycle of destruction, decay, and reassembly with no end in sight. <br><br>What will it take to survive in such a place?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4041580/extras/0e3ae732ecc25c27023e1a27fce9ef1e.poster.avif?t=1780546970\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4041580/extras/0e3ae732ecc25c27023e1a27fce9ef1e.webm?t=1780546970\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4041580/extras/0e3ae732ecc25c27023e1a27fce9ef1e.mp4?t=1780546970\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>", "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>FPS Mech Action</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pilot a mass of steel through a single player campaign set in decrepit factories, burning refineries, war torn deserts, and rusted salvage yards.  <br><i>Discover, Destroy, Scavenge.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4041580/extras/fbe60f0bb513eb91fa04084aebfa0b65.poster.avif?t=1780546970\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4041580/extras/fbe60f0bb513eb91fa04084aebfa0b65.webm?t=1780546970\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4041580/extras/fbe60f0bb513eb91fa04084aebfa0b65.mp4?t=1780546970\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Break Them Apart, Piece By Piece</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Target enemy weapons or armor and be rewarded with extra resources. Or crush them quickly with overwhelming firepower.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>But be mindful the enemy can do the same to you...</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4041580/extras/f27fc33e3a42e2b65d38d30d79438a52.poster.avif?t=1780546970\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4041580/extras/f27fc33e3a42e2b65d38d30d79438a52.webm?t=1780546970\" type=\"video/web